---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13615550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(361) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Roaches Under Sink Victoria TX | Cockroach Treatment" description="Roaches under the sink or in cabinets in Victoria, TX? Professional treatment eliminates harborage and stops the infestation.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Roaches Under Sink</div>
      <h1>Roaches Under the Sink</h1>
      <p>Moisture and food debris make kitchens and bathrooms ideal for cockroaches. We treat the places they hide.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Act Quickly</h2>
      <p>German cockroaches reproduce rapidly. A small population under the sink can become a widespread problem in weeks. Professional baits and residuals reach the cracks and voids where sprays miss.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Get Roach Treatment</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
